WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: sl

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.281
Jutro se začne ob reki Kolpi.

00:00:03.405 --> 00:00:05.156
Deset minut hoje,

00:00:05.307 --> 00:00:06.562
in si v reki.

00:00:06.864 --> 00:00:09.375
Kopanje, ki se ga ne naveličaš.

00:00:09.641 --> 00:00:11.250
Naravni tobogan,

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:13.125
in plitvina do pasu.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.875
Dve hiši, dva naslova v Gribljah.

00:00:17.205 --> 00:00:19.688
Štirje samostojni apartmaji.

00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:22.969
Sedem ležišč v dveh spalnicah,

00:00:23.365 --> 00:00:26.250
in nadstavna postelja za otroke.

00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:30.000
Kuhinje, opremljene do podrobnosti.

00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:33.281
Vsaka hiša svojo teraso in vrt.

00:00:33.478 --> 00:00:35.156
letno kuhinjo,

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.500
in pergolo v senci.

00:00:37.854 --> 00:00:40.312
Otrokom travnik z vrati,

00:00:40.626 --> 00:00:43.125
in pogača iz lastne peči.

00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:45.938
Topla voda kar zunaj,

00:00:46.102 --> 00:00:47.812
in vrt, ki je ves vaš.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:51.094
Mehurčki pod visečimi cvetlicami.

00:00:51.224 --> 00:00:52.500
In ko se stemni,

00:00:52.846 --> 00:00:55.312
čez vrt steče vrsta luči.

00:00:55.726 --> 00:01:00.000
River Kolpa Apartments,
Griblje. Pokličite Majdo.
